        "text_width": "regular",
        "title": "Slot Cars",
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/slot-cars\">Slot cars</a> are an excellent choice for both beginner and advanced hobbyists. It is a thrilling, interactive hobby for car enthusiasts and anyone who enjoys speed and competition. We have top-notch slot car brands at <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.com\">Hearns Hobbies</a>, such as <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/carrera\">Carrera</a>, which is more popular with younger racers, and <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/scalextric\">Scalextric</a>, which is popular with older racers.<br/><br/>Choose from a huge selection of slot cars! We stock a wide range of vehicles for the everyday driver, club racers, builders, and collectors.</p>",
