        "1658930183f010c50f-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are slot cars?",
            "answer": "<p>Slot cars are one of the oldest hobbies, which consist of little cars with a front guide running along a preset track. The driver has to control the speed to go as fast as possible without flipping out of the track. Traditional analog tracks allow one car per lane.</p>"
          }
        },
        "1658930183f010c50f-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I maintain my slot cars?",
            "answer": "<p>The most important aspect of the maintenance is dusting the cars and replacing the contacts braids. Get the scalextric braids <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/products/scalextric-braid-pack-6?_pos=1&_sid=887d49bf3&_ss=r\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a>.</p>"
          }
